<title>POLAND: POLISH 91-DAY NBP-BILL AVG YIELD UP TO 23.45 PCT.</title>
<headline>POLISH 91-DAY NBP-BILL AVG YIELD UP TO 23.45 PCT.</headline>
<dateline>WARSAW 1997-08-12</dateline>
<text>
<p>The National Bank of Poland sold 56 million zlotys of 91-day NBP-bills at today's auction after Polish banks bid for 785 million zlotys, the central bank said.</p>
<p>The average yield at the tender was 23.45 percent, up from 23.00 percent on July 30.</p>
<p>-- Warsaw Newsroom +48 2 653 9700</p>
